     "\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t<div title=\"Page 4\">\n\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">The simplest procedure for installing MAPfastR and all the required binaries is to use the command in R:  </p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">install.packages(&#39;MAPfastR&#39;,repos=&#39;<a href=\"http://www.computationalgenetics.se/MAPfastR\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.computationalgenetics.se/MAPfastR&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793246875491000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2GXhz-AUgQ0jNGApeO1XME\">http://www.computationalgenetics.se/MAPfastR</a>&#39;)</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">R version 2.15.3 or higher is required. </p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">This will work for Windows and OSX but not for Liux.</p><p></p>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>"
